  "description": "EBOBII crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C52 H54 Lu4 N4 O20 2+,Cl4 Zn1 2-,2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Zn1 (Zn) has 0 O neighbors; Zn1A (Zn) has 0 O neighbors; Lu1 (Lu) has 8 O neighbors; Lu2 (Lu) has 6 O neighbors; Lu1A (Lu) has 8 O neighbors; Lu2A (Lu) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.590-3.734 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.78-109.02°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C52H58Cl4Lu4N4O22Zn. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
